  type: resource
  url: https://www.grassrootseconomics.org/pages/sarafu-network
  resource_type: project
  is_source_system_candidate: true
  link_status: active
  notes: >-
    Runs the Sarafu Network in Kenya — local "community asset vouchers" for
    trading goods/services when national-currency cash is scarce, now on the
    Celo blockchain, with feature-phone (USSD) access requiring no
    smartphone or internet plan. Cited in what-is-blockchain.md as a live
    community-currency network, with usage figures captured separately as a
    claim-evidence object (see 08-claim-evidence.yaml).
  related_concepts:
    - blockchain
